Machine Learning project where the goal is to have an audio file and transfer it into MIDI

For the current stage of the project, I will be using the TinySOL2020 database: https://zenodo.org/records/3685331
(I couldn't put it into this folder because it was too much space, but just make a folder called data and put it into data)
Current Stage:
    Working on single note from a singular instrument, planning to implement this with a Random Forest Classifier